├── "Cost-effective EMR" → Spot on task nodes + transient clusters
├── "Reduce Glue costs" → Auto Scaling + Job Bookmarks (avoid reprocessing)
├── "Predictable Redshift workload" → Reserved Instances
└── "Bursty Redshift workload" → Serverless or Concurrency Scaling

